   118                          ; -------------------
   119                          ; THE 'ZX81 KEYBOARD'
   120                          ; -------------------
   121                          ;
   122                          ;                                [] mosaic graphic
   123                          ;
   124                          ; +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+
   125                          ; | EDIT| |  AND| | THEN| |  TO | |  <- | |   v | |   ^ | |  -> | |GRAPH| | RUB |
   126                          ; | 1 []| | 2 []| | 3 []| | 4 []| | 5 []| | 6 []| | 7 []| | 8 []| | 9   | | 0   |
   127                          ; +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+
   128                          ;
   129                          ;  PLOT   UNPLOT    REM     RUN     RAND  RETURN    IF     INPUT   POKE    PRINT
   130                          ; +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+
   131                          ; |  "" | |  OR | | STEP| |  <= | |  <> | |  >= | |   $ | |   ( | |   ) | |   " |
   132                          ; | Q []| | W []| | E []| | R []| | T []| | Y []| | U   | | I   | | O   | | P   |
   133                          ; +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+
   134                          ;
   135                          ;   NEW    SAVE     DIM     FOR     GOTO   GOSUB   LOAD    LIST     LET
   136                          ; +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+
   137                          ; | STOP| |LPRNT| | SLOW| | FAST| |LLIST| |  ** | |   - | |   + | |   = | |FUNCT|
   138                          ; | A []| | S []| | D []| | F []| | G []| | H []| | J   | | K   | | L   | | N/L |
   139                          ; +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+
   140                          ;
   141                          ;          COPY    CLEAR   CONT     CLS   SCROLL    NEXT   PAUSE           BREAK
   142                          ; +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+
   143                          ; |     | |   : | |   ; | |   ? | |   / | |   * | |   < | |   > | |   , | |   à|
   144                          ; |SHIFT| | Z   | | X   | | C   | | V   | | B   | | N   | | M   | | .   | |SPACE|
   145                          ; +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+ +-----+
   146                          ;
   147                          ;
   148                          ; Graphic Character Locations
   149                          ; ---------------------------
   150                          ;
   151                          ;  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+    +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+
   152                          ;  |# |  | #|  |  |  |  |  |# |    |  |  |##|  | #|  |  |  |  |
   153                          ;  |  |  |  |  | #|  |# |  |# |    |##|  |  |  | #|  |  |  |  |
   154                          ;  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+    +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+
   155                          ;
   156                          ;  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+    +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+
   157                          ;  | #|  |# |  |##|  |##|  | #|    |# |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |
   158                          ;  |##|  |##|  |# |  | #|  |# |    | #|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |
   159                          ;  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+    +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+
   160                          ;
   161                          ;  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+    +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+
   162                          ;  |XX|  |XX|  |  |  |xx|  |##|    |xx|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |
   163                          ;  |XX|  |  |  |XX|  |##|  |xx|    |xx|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |
   164                          ;  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+    +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+
   165                          ;
   166                          ;  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+    +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+
   167                          ;  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |    |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |
   168                          ;  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |    |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |
   169                          ;  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+    +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+  +--+
