  4440                          
  4441                          ; THE 'REM' COMMAND ROUTINE
  4442                          
  4443                          REM:
  4444  0d6a  c9                        ret                     ;
  4445                          
  4446                          ; ---
  4447                          
  4448                          CLASS_2:
